# Terminal recording of docs/demo.sh. Not rendered yet: no recorder was installed
# when this was written. With https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs installed:
#   vhs docs/demo.tape        # writes docs/demo.gif
Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 520
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "bash docs/demo.sh"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
